12
01:09:00,000 --> 01:09:06,000
After being submitted to and rejected by the MPAA numerous times, Cherry Falls premiered in May 1999 at Marché du Film in France and subsequently
screened at several film festivals in some countries in early 2000, but did not have a theatrical release in the United States.

13
01:14:45,000 --> 01:14:51,000
